// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2191756136" "Reporters have managed to snap several photographs of Dr. Vahzilok, but we still have no idea who he is. See, Vahzilok always wears a surgical mask. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go into the sewers and see if you can find a clue to Dr. Vahzilok's identity.</A> If we can learn more about him, we may be able to stop him before he hurts anybody else."
