"P1641865736" "Chiron Medical Center is tracking a disturbing trend. It seems that whenever the Vahzilok pass through an area, they leave an epidemic in their wake. People have reported hacking coughs, weakness, and fainting after witnessing a Vahzilok raid.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to patrol Galaxy City and quell any Vahzilok activity</A>. Those creatures are a real health hazard!"
// AcceptString :
"P3860073973" "Patrol Galaxy City and quell any Vahzilok activity."
